    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present this spacious duplex apartment, ideally situated in the popular Waterside development in Malahide. The property benefits from its own-door entrance and offers well-proportioned accommodation arranged over two floors.\n\nOn entering, a private entrance leads to a staircase ascending to the main level of the apartment. The entrance hall provides access to the living room, kitchen, double bedroom and WC. The living room benefits from private doors opening onto an east-facing balcony, while the adjoining kitchen is fitted with a range of eye and floor-level units. The double bedroom on this level benefits from its own private balcony, with a WC and wash hand basin located off the hallway.\n\nA further flight of stairs leads to the upper floor, where the landing provides access to excellent storage, including the gas-fired central heating boiler. There is also a ancillary room currently used as a bedroom. Please note that this room is not classified as a bedroom and is not included in the stated bedroom count.\n\nThe upper floor further comprises a main bathroom fitted with a bath with shower attachment, WC and wash hand basin. There is also a generous double bedroom with a Juliet balcony and private en-suite, complete with WC, wash hand basin and shower. A further generous single bedroom completes the accommodation.\n\nOverall, 7 The Water Rill offers spacious and versatile accommodation across two floors, with the benefit of an east-facing balcony off the living room, a further private balcony adjoining the main-level double bedroom and excellent additional living and storage options. The property is ideally suited to those seeking a well-proportioned duplex apartment in a popular residential development in Malahide.\n\nThe property is ideally located within the popular Waterside development, close to Malahide Village with its excellent selection of shops, cafés, restaurants and amenities. Malahide DART station, local schools, Malahide Beach and Marina are all within easy reach, while Dublin Airport and the M50 are also readily accessible."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \nBright entrance hall providing access to the main living accommodation and upper floor.\n\nLiving Room - 2.98m x 3.99m\nWell-proportioned living room with private doors opening onto an east-facing balcony.\n\nKitchen - 2.98m x 2.36m\nFitted kitchen with a range of eye and floor-level units and access to the hallway.\n\nWC - \nConvenient guest WC fitted with a WC and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom One - 5.14m x 4.07m\nSpacious double bedroom with access to a private balcony.\n\nBedroom Two - 2.98m x 4.45\nGenerous double bedroom with a Juliet balcony and access to a private en-suite bathroom.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.16m x 2.02m\nPrivate en-suite fitted with WC, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom Three - 2.22m x 2.63m\nWell-proportioned single bedroom offering versatile accommodation.\n\nAncillary Room - 2.98m x 3.43m\nVersatile additional room currently used as a bedroom. Please note this room is not classified as a bedroom and is not included in the stated bedroom count.\n\nBathroom - 1.70m x 1.99m\nMain bathroom fitted with WC, wash hand basin and bath with shower attachment.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Management fees: 1000 per annum (approx)</li><li> Designated parking space</li><li> Spacious duplex apartment</li><li> Own-door private entrance</li><li> East-facing balcony off the living room</li><li> Additional private balcony off Bedroom One</li><li> Three bedrooms</li><li> Additional versatile ancillary room</li><li> Private en-suite to Bedroom Two</li><li> Gas-fired central heating</li><li> Popular Waterside development</li><li> Close to Malahide Village and local amenities</ul>"
      },
